 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "StoneAdvisor ⊣ Dimension Stone Plant Operations Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION
 actor for dimension-stone (granite/marble/limestone/sandstone slab,
 monument, countertop) plants (quarried-block intake -> sawing
 (gang-saw/bridge-saw/wire-saw) -> polishing -> edge-profiling/CNC
 shaping -> inspection production line) -- not direct sawing-line/
 polishing-line-equipment control authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Eleven concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's four HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct sawing-line/
 polishing-line-equipment control), permanent sawing/polishing-line-
 actuate block, independent equipment verification/registration before
 maintenance scheduling, independent batch verification/registration
 before shipment coordination, independent shipment-weight recompute
 against the batch's own logged weight, double-schedule guard,
 product-type validation, slab-thickness-tolerance plausibility
 validation, and polish-gloss-level plausibility validation.
 Safety-concern flagging (sawing/polishing-line-equipment safety --
 crystalline-silica-dust exposure, saw-blade kickback, heavy-slab
